<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's QTC 2005 bonds yield 7.272 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's QTC 2005 bonds yield 7.272 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Queensland Treasury Corporation (QTC) said on Monday its tender of its 6.5 percent June 2005 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.272 percent.</p>
</text>
